l,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3008943954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107316#issuecomment-3008943954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107316","id":3008943954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zWNdS","user":{"login":"Fireye04","id":45439844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDM5ODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45439844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04","html_url":"https://github.com/Fireye04","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T15:45:16Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T15:45:16Z","body":"Awesome; In that case I can successfully report full reproduction on both 4.5dev5 and 4.4.1 (arch/niri now). \n\nIn my testing I have observed that the recording will always match the runtime, and never the pre-set \"viewport size\" settings. If by chance the runtime viewport were to be set to the preset setting, then it will record at that preset setting, however if the window is altered, that change is mirrored in the video's output.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3008943954/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3107469944","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107316#issuecomment-3107469944","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107316","id":3107469944,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65ODp4","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T11:50:08Z","updated_at":"2025-07-24T14:02:56Z","body":"This can result in buffer overflows at least for the OGV writer when the resolution increases. No video encoder supports changing resolutions in the middle of a video, AFAIK. MJPEG and PNG, being only intra-frames, seem to handle it without crashing, others will not.\n\nI can write a workaround for the OGV writer so that it fails when the resolution changes to avoid buffer overflows, but the underlying issue is the changing resolutions.\n\nI'm already working on the workaround. I'll create a PR as soon as possible for review.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3107469944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3108951125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107316#issuecomment-3108951125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107316","id":3108951125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65TtRV","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T14:41:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T14:41:55Z","body":"I've changed the wording of the issue because I think the root issue is allowing window size changes in movie mode without any warning, and the user or the movie writers have to handle them. Users will probably already know that the window size shouldn't change when in movie mode, but there are some instances where they might not be aware of the change, as it happens in embed game mode.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3108951125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3109443208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107316#issuecomment-3109443208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107316","id":3109443208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65VlaI","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T17:04:23Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T17:04:23Z","body":"We should probably have a `movie` override for the `resizable` project setting that defaults to `false`, so you can't resize a window that is recording a movie by default. This would prevent most resolution changes during recording, which are often accidental.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3109443208/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]